### 2. Data Architecture & Relational Modeling (Star Schema)
To support deep-dive analysis, I architected a centralized Star Schema model[cite: 1]. By establishing relationships between the core transactional data (`Query1`) and key operational dimensions, the model enables seamless cross-filtering across customer demographics and staff performance[cite: 1].

![Star Schema Data Architecture](./assets/cs-star-schema.png)

* **Centralized Fact Table:** `Query1` aggregates revenue and rental events for precise KPI tracking[cite: 1].
* **Multi-Dimensional Visibility:** Connections to `public_customer_list`, `public_staff_list`, `sales_by_store`, and `sales_by_film_category` allow leadership to pinpoint exactly which segments or team members are driving growth[cite: 1].

